  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If at some time&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math>,&nbsp;the thickness of ice is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;and at time&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>dt</mi></math>, the thickeness is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>dx</mi></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>&#961;Adx</mi></mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi>fusion</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>kA</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac><mi>dt</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi>fusion</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>'</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><msub><mo>'</mo><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><msub><mo>'</mo><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>'</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>hours</mi></math></p>",
